#: src/onboarding/texts.tsx
msgid "wizard.consent.claude"
msgstr "Yuo will run the Claude Code app installed on this computer, signed in with your own account, to write lessons and answer as your tutor. Yuo never reads or stores your Claude sign-in. This use counts against your subscription's limits, and Anthropic may bill use by third-party tools as extra usage; Yuo stops and tells you when it sees an extra-usage answer. You can switch to another model at any time in Settings."

#: src/onboarding/texts.tsx
msgid "wizard.consent.codex"
msgstr "Yuo will run the Codex app installed on this computer, signed in with your own account, to write lessons and answer as your tutor. Yuo never reads or stores your ChatGPT sign-in. This use counts against your plan's limits. You can switch to another model at any time in Settings."

